Subject: [PATCH 2056/3799] soh: rename func_80AB7420 -> EnNiw_WaitToLand

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: waits for ground contact, then re-arms the hit counter and returns to idle
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Niw/z_en_niw.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Niw/z_en_niw.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Niw/z_en_niw.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Niw/z_en_niw.c
index 332d3ec83..92bdfb71d 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Niw/z_en_niw.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Niw/z_en_niw.c
@@ -878,7 +878,8 @@ void EnNiw_Flee(EnNiw* this, PlayState* play) {
     }
 }
 
-void func_80AB7420(EnNiw* this, PlayState* play) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80AB7420: waits for ground contact, then re-arms the hit counter and returns to idle
+void EnNiw_WaitToLand(EnNiw* this, PlayState* play) {
     if (this->actor.bgCheckFlags & BGCHECKFLAG_GROUND) {
         this->unk_2A4 = (s16)Rand_ZeroFloat(3.99f) + 5;
         this->actionFunc = EnNiw_ResetAction;
@@ -1054,7 +1055,7 @@ void EnNiw_Update(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
         }
 
         this->unk_2A8 = 0;
-        this->actionFunc = func_80AB7420;
+        this->actionFunc = EnNiw_WaitToLand;  // was func_80AB7420 [LLM:HIGH]
         return;
     }
 
